## Directory structure

```
{{PROJECT_ID}}/
├── 00_data/{raw,processed,references}   # READ-ONLY input data
├── 01_modules/                          # toolkits (submodules)
├── 02_analysis/{config,helpers,scripts,notebooks}
├── 03_results/
│   ├── objects/                         # checkpoint state (.h5ad, .rds) — not a deliverable
│   ├── 01_qc/                           # tables + figures for the QC phase
│   └── _scratch/                        # throwaway plots/tables
├── docs/                                # public-facing: plan, guides
└── logs/
```

Each `NN_phase/` folder under `03_results/` holds the tables **and** figures for that phase;
reusable checkpoint objects live in `03_results/objects/`. Add `02_*`, `03_*` as the plan
in `docs/plan/` progresses.

